  - m_Id: 4000000037
    m_Localized: Осталось дней
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000038
    m_Localized: Действие
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000039
    m_Localized: Заказать
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000040
    m_Localized: Отмена
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000041
    m_Localized: Нет доступных товаров.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000042
    m_Localized: Нет товаров в выбранной категории.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000043
    m_Localized: Нет активных заказов.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000101
    m_Localized: Тхабо Ндлову
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000102
    m_Localized: Cape Horizon Trading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000103
    m_Localized: Региональный оптовый покупатель, работающий с розничными поставками, товарами для дома и практичными ресурсами колонии.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000104
    m_Localized: Вэй Чжан
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000105
    m_Localized: Jade River Imports
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000106
    m_Localized: Крупный импортёр потребительских товаров.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000107
    m_Localized: Давит Бекеле
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000108
    m_Localized: Abyssinia Coffee Partners
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000109
    m_Localized: Опытный торговый партнёр, работающий с сельскохозяйственными товарами.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000110
    m_Localized: Господин Макрон
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000111
    m_Localized: Лунная бюрократия Франции
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000112
    m_Localized: Лунное ведомство предпочитает документы каждой поставке.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000113
    m_Localized: Арджун Патель
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000114
    m_Localized: Lotus Bridge Exports
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000115
    m_Localized: Коммерческий партнёр, заинтересованный в крупных заказах.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000116
    m_Localized: София Рамирес
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000117
    m_Localized: Sol Norte Distribution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000118
    m_Localized: Покупатель, занимающийся поставками для городской торговли.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000119
    m_Localized: Кай Бегей
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000120
    m_Localized: Red Mesa Artisan Cooperative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000121
    m_Localized: Представитель сообщества, выступающий за честную торговлю.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000122
    m_Localized: Илон Мускович
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000123
    m_Localized: Глава NASA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000124
    m_Localized: Запускает ракеты раньше сроков и опережает панику. Любит, когда план работает, даже если меняется каждые десять минут.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000125
    m_Localized: Господин Дональд
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000126
    m_Localized: Американский бизнесмен
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000127
    m_Localized: Компания, которая закончила пятьдесят войн.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638843727872
    m_Localized: Изолятор безопасности
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419648
    m_Localized: "\xABПоследний шаг добавляет дисциплины камню и стали: изолированное крыло поддержки для инцидентов, контрабанды и тяжелых трудовых споров\xBB."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419649
    m_Localized: Покупателям нужна база, которая сможет поглотить конфликт и не развалиться.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419650
    m_Localized: Постройте изолятор и пройдите финальную проверку безопасности.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419651
    m_Localized: Проверка изолятора завершила дисциплинарную программу.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419652
    m_Localized: Проверка показала, что изолятор слишком слаб для реальных инцидентов.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638923419653
    m_Localized: Подготовка изолятора
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613952
    m_Localized: Расширьте среду обитания и добавьте спальные места в защитное крыло.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613953
    m_Localized: Достигните ширины жизненного модуля 10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613954
    m_Localized: Постройте 2 модуля сна.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6000000001
    m_Localized: Обзор безопасности
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6000000002
    m_Localized: Получите отзыв и пройдите окончательную проверку безопасности.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6000000003
    m_Localized: Пройдите проверку содержания.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613955
    m_Localized: Контракт на глубокую добычу полезных ископаемых
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613956
    m_Localized: "\xABПокупателям из Южной Африки нужен более жесткий сигнал для горнодобывающей промышленности: большие нагрузки, больший темп и меньшая устойчивость к дрейфу\xBB."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613957
    m_Localized: "\xABПервый тест прост: перемещайте более тяжелую руду без оправданий\xBB."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613958
    m_Localized: Подготовьте титановую посылку и отправьте ее вовремя.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613959
    m_Localized: На партию тяжелых грузов был заключен второй, более суровый контракт.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613960
    m_Localized: Контракт на добычу полезных ископаемых был сорван прежде, чем это убедило крупных покупателей.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613961
    m_Localized: Глубокий вырез
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613962
    m_Localized: Соберите достаточно титана, чтобы удовлетворить более требовательного промышленного покупателя.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613963
    m_Localized: Накопите 16 Титанов.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613964
    m_Localized: Магистральная магистраль
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613965
    m_Localized: 'The second request wants more than ore: it wants a backbone of
      storage, power, and processing that can survive stress.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613966
    m_Localized: The buyers now care about discipline, not just tonnage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613967
    m_Localized: Build the backbone and keep it stable long enough to earn trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613968
    m_Localized: The backbone held and pushed the contract into security territory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613969
    m_Localized: The backbone looked too weak for long-term heavy work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613970
    m_Localized: Mining Backbone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613971
    m_Localized: Add storage and a processing unit for the deeper mining program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613972
    m_Localized: Build 2 Storage buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613973
    m_Localized: Build 1 Regolith Processing Unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613974
    m_Localized: Efficiency Audit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613975
    m_Localized: 'The final Chinese step is managerial: keep capital visible, widen
      the colony, and survive a hard efficiency audit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613976
    m_Localized: The audit team does not care about your excuses, only your ratios.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613977
    m_Localized: Prepare the colony for a cold efficiency review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613978
    m_Localized: The audit cleared the colony for industrial expansion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613979
    m_Localized: The review found too much slack in the system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613980
    m_Localized: Efficiency Buffer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613981
    m_Localized: Keep enough gold on hand and widen the habitat spine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613982
    m_Localized: Reach 250 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613983
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613984
    m_Localized: Second Production Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613985
    m_Localized: 'With bulk extraction proven, the next demand is a tougher one:
      add a second processing backbone and keep it stable under load.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613986
    m_Localized: This is the point where scale turns into systems engineering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613987
    m_Localized: Build the line, store the output, and hold power steady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613988
    m_Localized: The second line held and moved the program into audit phase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613989
    m_Localized: The line buckled before it could be trusted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613990
    m_Localized: Second Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613991
    m_Localized: Add a new regolith processor and enough storage to feed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613992
    m_Localized: Build 1 Regolith Processing Unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613993
    m_Localized: Build 2 Storage buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613994
    m_Localized: Industrial Scale Trial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613995
    m_Localized: Chinese buyers want proof that the moon base can move raw material
      in bulk, not just in curated science lots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613996
    m_Localized: 'The request is blunt: scale matters more than elegance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613997
    m_Localized: Fill the stockpile and send the first heavy batch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613998
    m_Localized: The industrial desk approved a larger expansion package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927613999
    m_Localized: The batch never reached the scale benchmark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614000
    m_Localized: Bulk Extraction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614001
    m_Localized: Pull enough titan to make the industrial buyers take the base seriously.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614002
    m_Localized: Accumulate 20 Titan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614003
    m_Localized: Stability Program Review
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614004
    m_Localized: 'The final Ethiopian request turns your humane base into a public
      program: prove it can stay kind without becoming weak.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614005
    m_Localized: This review will decide whether the colony can be sold as a stable
      community, not just a mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614006
    m_Localized: Keep beds ready, hold a gold buffer, and pass the program review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614007
    m_Localized: The program review concluded that the colony can sustain more civilian
      life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614008
    m_Localized: The review judged the colony too brittle for expansion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614009
    m_Localized: Program Readiness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614010
    m_Localized: Add beds and keep enough funding for a longer support cycle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614011
    m_Localized: Build 2 Sleep Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614012
    m_Localized: Reach 200 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614013
    m_Localized: Rest Zone Program
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614014
    m_Localized: 'The next phase wants the base to feel humane: food, rest, and a
      recovery loop that can stay calm under pressure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614015
    m_Localized: A stable base is measured by how people recover, not just how they
      mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614016
    m_Localized: Build the rest zone and keep its utilities healthy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614017
    m_Localized: The rest zone proved the colony can care for its people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614018
    m_Localized: The support loop never looked steady enough to trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614019
    m_Localized: Rest Zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614020
    m_Localized: Expand the habitat and add a dinner space for the relief program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614021
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614022
    m_Localized: Build 1 Dinner Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614023
    m_Localized: Sustainment Goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614024
    m_Localized: The first Ethiopian request focuses on dependable sustainment cargo
      for a colony that still feels exposed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614025
    m_Localized: The cargo is modest, but the promise behind it matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614026
    m_Localized: Prepare the sustainment batch and deliver it on schedule.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614027
    m_Localized: The sustainment goods arrived and opened a broader stability program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614028
    m_Localized: The sustainment program stumbled before it started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614029
    m_Localized: Relief Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614030
    m_Localized: Gather aluminium for the sustainment package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614031
    m_Localized: Accumulate 10 aluminium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614032
    m_Localized: Habitat Certification Wing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614033
    m_Localized: With samples secured, the bureau now wants a proper scientific habitat
      with reliable life support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614034
    m_Localized: Engineers from Europe drafted a certification checklist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614035
    m_Localized: Extend the habitat and keep the utility line stable long enough
      for sign-off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614036
    m_Localized: The wing passed structural certification.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614037
    m_Localized: Certification failed before the observers arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614038
    m_Localized: Research Habitat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614039
    m_Localized: Expand the living band and add sleeping capacity for the visiting
      team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614040
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614041
    m_Localized: Build 1 Sleep Module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614042
    m_Localized: European Colony Inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614043
    m_Localized: 'The final French request is ceremonial and political: host an official
      inspection without letting the base look improvised.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614044
    m_Localized: The inspectors want a colony that feels permanent, not lucky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614045
    m_Localized: Prepare a dining space, keep a cash reserve, and welcome the inspection
      convoy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614046
    m_Localized: The European review stamped the colony as a serious scientific outpost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614047
    m_Localized: The inspectors saw too much improvisation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614048
    m_Localized: Inspection Window
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614049
    m_Localized: Set up a dignified host space and keep funding visible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614050
    m_Localized: Build 1 Dinner Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614051
    m_Localized: Reach 220 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614052
    m_Localized: Regolith for Research
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614053
    m_Localized: French labs want clean regolith shipments to justify a larger scientific
      station on the moon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614054
    m_Localized: The first batch is meant for a fragile research window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614055
    m_Localized: Secure the regolith and send it before the science slot expires.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614056
    m_Localized: The laboratory shipment impressed the bureau.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614057
    m_Localized: The regolith never reached the scientists in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614058
    m_Localized: Research Stockpile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614059
    m_Localized: Gather regolith fit for laboratory use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614060
    m_Localized: Accumulate 12 Rogalite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614061
    m_Localized: Civic Guest Program
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614062
    m_Localized: 'The final Indian request is a public-facing one: open the first
      civic guest module and prove the colony can welcome non-specialists.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614063
    m_Localized: The guest program is meant to humanize the colony, not just fund
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614064
    m_Localized: Finish the public-facing module and pass the final visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614065
    m_Localized: The guest program launched and broadened the colony's reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614066
    m_Localized: The visit made the colony feel too improvised for civilians.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614067
    m_Localized: Public Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614068
    m_Localized: Add water support and keep a visible cash reserve for the public
      launch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614069
    m_Localized: Build 1 Water Reclamation unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614070
    m_Localized: Reach 220 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614071
    m_Localized: Delegation Habitat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614072
    m_Localized: 'The next phase is social as much as technical: create a larger,
      calmer habitat for a civilian delegation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614073
    m_Localized: A civilian delegation needs more than a miner bunk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614074
    m_Localized: Expand the habitat and keep the daily support loop visible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614075
    m_Localized: The habitat is ready for a formal delegation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614076
    m_Localized: The delegation wing never felt stable enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614077
    m_Localized: Delegation Quarters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614078
    m_Localized: Widen the habitat and add sleeping capacity for official guests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614079
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 12.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614080
    m_Localized: Build 2 Sleep Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614081
    m_Localized: Civil Supply Bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614082
    m_Localized: 'India wants a dependable civil supply bridge first: practical materials,
      predictable timing, no heroic improvisation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614083
    m_Localized: The first request is about trust, not spectacle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614084
    m_Localized: Prepare the base materials package and send it on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614085
    m_Localized: The bridge held and the delegation planners moved forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614086
    m_Localized: The materials package slipped before the first delegation even launched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614087
    m_Localized: Common Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614088
    m_Localized: Gather aluminium for the civil supply package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614089
    m_Localized: Accumulate 14 aluminium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614090
    m_Localized: Base Celebration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614091
    m_Localized: 'The final request turns the colony into a stage: hold a visible
      event without exposing how thin your support margins are.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614092
    m_Localized: A public event can sell a story faster than any shipment manifest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614093
    m_Localized: Build the event buffer, keep funding on hand, and pass the final
      review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614094
    m_Localized: The celebration landed and turned the colony into a destination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614095
    m_Localized: The event exposed more fragility than charm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614096
    m_Localized: Event Budget
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614097
    m_Localized: Widen the habitat and keep enough gold for a visible event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614098
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614099
    m_Localized: Reach 180 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614100
    m_Localized: Mess Hall Service Wing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614101
    m_Localized: 'With dispatches working, the next task is service quality inside
      the colony: food, flow, and practical support under load.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614102
    m_Localized: A colony that can sell goods should also know how to host people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638927614103
    m_Localized: Build the service wing and keep it operating for a full cycle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808256
    m_Localized: The service wing proved the base can host a steady crowd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808257
    m_Localized: The wing never looked ready for real traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808258
    m_Localized: Service Wing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808259
    m_Localized: Add dining capacity and reinforce the logistics spine behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808260
    m_Localized: Build 1 Dinner Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808261
    m_Localized: Build 2 Storage buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808262
    m_Localized: Service Supply Loop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808263
    m_Localized: 'Mexico wants a smaller but reliable service loop: repeatable dispatches
      that prove the base can support daily commerce.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808264
    m_Localized: This is the kind of contract that looks easy until your base gets
      busy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808265
    m_Localized: Prepare the first service batch and send it without delay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808266
    m_Localized: The service loop started cleanly and opened the next request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808267
    m_Localized: The service loop stalled before trust could build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808268
    m_Localized: Local Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808269
    m_Localized: Gather regolith for the fast service dispatch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808270
    m_Localized: Accumulate 10 Rogalite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808271
    m_Localized: Fair Trade Sample
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808272
    m_Localized: The cooperative wants proof that your extraction can respect limits
      and still keep a promise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808273
    m_Localized: This contract is small by design. Trust matters more than volume.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808274
    m_Localized: Prepare the fair-trade sample and send it without diluting its value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808275
    m_Localized: The sample shipment built trust with the cooperative.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808276
    m_Localized: The sample never made it through the trust test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808277
    m_Localized: Careful Reserve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808278
    m_Localized: Gather a modest regolith sample without turning the request into
      bulk mining.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808279
    m_Localized: Accumulate 8 Rogalite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808280
    m_Localized: Cultural Habitat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808281
    m_Localized: 'The next request asks for space, not cargo: a visible cultural
      and memorial wing inside the colony.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808282
    m_Localized: A colony without memory looks temporary, no matter how rich it becomes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808283
    m_Localized: Build the cultural wing and keep the essentials stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808284
    m_Localized: The memorial wing gave the colony a sense of continuity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808285
    m_Localized: The space felt too thin to carry the meaning it needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808286
    m_Localized: Cultural Space
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808287
    m_Localized: Expand the habitat and add a visible landmark path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808288
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808289
    m_Localized: Build 1 Bridge section.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808290
    m_Localized: Stewardship Review
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808291
    m_Localized: 'The final cooperative step is philosophical and practical: keep
      a buffer, show restraint, and pass a stewardship review.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808292
    m_Localized: This review asks whether your colony can grow without losing its
      judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808293
    m_Localized: Keep a reserve, add living capacity, and pass the stewardship review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808294
    m_Localized: The cooperative endorsed the colony's quieter path forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808295
    m_Localized: The review judged the colony too extractive and too thinly buffered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808296
    m_Localized: Stewardship Buffer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808297
    m_Localized: Hold a gold reserve and add another calm sleeping space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808298
    m_Localized: Reach 160 stored Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808299
    m_Localized: Build 1 Sleep Module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808300
    m_Localized: Orbital Guest Corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808301
    m_Localized: Now SpaceX wants the base to look like a real transfer stop, not
      a mining camp with a lucky launch pad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808302
    m_Localized: Commercial planners are testing whether your base can host transit
      traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808303
    m_Localized: Expand the guest corridor and make it inspection-safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808304
    m_Localized: The corridor passed SpaceX review and unlocked the tourism pilot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808305
    m_Localized: The corridor looked temporary and under-serviced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808306
    m_Localized: Orbital Expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808307
    m_Localized: Add storage and a wider habitat spine for transfer crews.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808308
    m_Localized: Build 2 Storage buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808309
    m_Localized: Reach life-module width 10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808310
    m_Localized: Dock Ring Metals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808311
    m_Localized: SpaceX wants a clean, fast metals route before committing to a permanent
      orbital exchange hub.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808312
    m_Localized: A launch slot is open, but only for a team that can move metal fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808313
    m_Localized: Stock the ring metals and push them out on the next mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808314
    m_Localized: The first hub shipment reached orbit intact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808315
    m_Localized: The launch window closed before the ring shipment moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808316
    m_Localized: Metal Stockpile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808317
    m_Localized: Gather titan and aluminium for the docking ring package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808318
    m_Localized: Accumulate 18 Titan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808319
    m_Localized: Accumulate 12 aluminium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808320
    m_Localized: First Tourist Wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808321
    m_Localized: 'The final SpaceX test is simple to say and hard to fake: host the
      first paying tourists without the base feeling fragile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808322
    m_Localized: A tourism pilot is pencilled into the launch board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808323
    m_Localized: Build the guest experience, keep support online, and pass the final
      welcome inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808324
    m_Localized: The first tourist wave left glowing reports and opened a new market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808325
    m_Localized: The guests saw too much mining camp and not enough colony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808326
    m_Localized: Guest Experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808327
    m_Localized: Add hospitality and keep oxygen stable for a full sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808328
    m_Localized: Build 1 Dinner Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808329
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Oxygen Station for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808330
    m_Localized: Containment Block Review
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808331
    m_Localized: 'The last request is political: build an isolated holding block
      for security incidents without destabilizing the colony economy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808332
    m_Localized: Security planners want an answer before the next policy hearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808333
    m_Localized: Create a detention-ready wing with food, beds, and buffer funding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808334
    m_Localized: The review board approved the moon security program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808335
    m_Localized: The block was judged too weak or too expensive to trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808336
    m_Localized: Containment Prep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808337
    m_Localized: Lay down the isolated support block and give it enough beds to function.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808338
    m_Localized: Build 3 Storage buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808339
    m_Localized: Build 2 Sleep Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808340
    m_Localized: Lunar Logistics Rush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808341
    m_Localized: A pressure test for American logistics. Build a reliable first shipment
      lane before regulators start asking questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808342
    m_Localized: Washington wants proof that your moon base can move freight on schedule.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808343
    m_Localized: A fast launch slot has been reserved. Do not waste it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808344
    m_Localized: The shipment landed cleanly and the logistics desk wants more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808345
    m_Localized: The lane broke down before the first audit even began.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51638931808346
    m_Localized: Logistics Stockpile
    m_Metadata:
